      "order": 0,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "1 RESOLUTION NO. 9811"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 1,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 2,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "A RESOLUTION introduced by Public Infrastructure Committee recommending"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 3,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "approval of Project No. 701070.00 for street improvements to SW"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 4,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "45th Street, from Gage Boulevard to Cambridge Avenue."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 5,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Governing Body adopted Resolution No. 9723 approving the2026-"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 6,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "2035 Capital Improvement Program (CIP) and the 2026-2028 Capital Improvement Budget"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 7,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "(CIB); and"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Resolution requires Governing Body approval for projects that are"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 9,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "ready for construction and whose total project budget exceeds $250,000; and"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 10,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "WHEREAS, on May 19, 2026, the Public Infrastructure Committee recommended"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 11,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "approval of the project(s)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 12,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED, BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 13,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "CITY OF TOPEKA, KANSAS, that Project No. 701070.00 for street improvements to SW"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 14,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "45th Street from Gage Boulevard to Cambridge Avenue as further described in Exhibit A"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 15,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "is hereby approved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 16,
      "style": "ListParagraph",
      "text": "ADOPTED and APPROVED by the Governing Body on June 2, 2026."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "order": 17,
      "style": "BodyText",
      "text": "19"
    },
